{"content":[{"c":["JEREMOTH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. One of Beker’s nine sons and a leader in Benjamin’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.7.8","r":"1Chr.7.8","rawR":"1Chr.7.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.7.8","value":"1Chr.7.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 7:8"},"). His name is rendered Jerimoth in some versions."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Benjamite, the son of Beriah and head of his family living in Jerusalem (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.14","r":"1Chr.8.14","rawR":"1Chr.8.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.14","value":"1Chr.8.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:14"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Levite of the family at Merari and one of Mushi’s three sons registered during David’s reign (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.23.23","r":"1Chr.23.23","rawR":"1Chr.23.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.23.23","value":"1Chr.23.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 23:23"},"). His name is alternately spelled Jerimoth here and in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.24.30","r":"1Chr.24.30","rawR":"1Chr.24.30","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.24.30","value":"1Chr.24.30"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 24:30"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Heman’s son and the leader of the 15th of 24 divisions of musicians trained for service in the house of the Lord (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.25.22","r":"1Chr.25.22","rawR":"1Chr.25.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.25.22","value":"1Chr.25.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 25:22"},", ",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," mg). Here and also in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.25.4","r":"1Chr.25.4","rawR":"1Chr.25.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.25.4","value":"1Chr.25.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 25:4"}," his name is spelled Jerimoth."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. Azriel’s son and the chief official of Naphtali’s tribe during David’s reign (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.27.19","r":"1Chr.27.19","rawR":"1Chr.27.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.27.19","value":"1Chr.27.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 27:19"},"). His name is spelled Jerimoth in some texts."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["6. One of Elam’s descendants who was encouraged by Ezra to divorce his foreign wife during the postexilic period (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.26","r":"Ezra.10.26","rawR":"Ezra.10.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.26","value":"Ezra.10.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:26"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["7. One of Zattu’s descendants who was encouraged by Ezra to divorce his foreign wife (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.27","r":"Ezra.10.27","rawR":"Ezra.10.27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.27","value":"Ezra.10.27"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:27"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["8. One of Bani’s descendants who was encouraged by Ezra to divorce his foreign wife (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.29","r":"Ezra.10.29","rawR":"Ezra.10.29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.29","value":"Ezra.10.29"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:29"},"). He is named “Ramoth” in the ",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Jeremoth","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 7:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.7.8","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.7.8","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.7.8"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.14","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.14","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.14"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 23:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.23.23","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.23.23","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.23.23"},{"anchorText":"1 Chronicles 24:30","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.24.30","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.24.30","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.24.30"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 25:22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.25.22","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.25.22","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.25.22"},{"anchorText":"1 Chronicles 25:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.25.4","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.25.4","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.25.4"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 27:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.27.19","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.27.19","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.27.19"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 10:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.10.26","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.10.26","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.10.26"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 10:27","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.10.27","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.10.27","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.10.27"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 10:29","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.10.29","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.10.29","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.10.29"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"362127ff8151e236aba62e23ab03c1f009a401cd59a35fab3167f7ee9a2cfb21","sourceItemName":"Jeremoth","sourceItemOrder":188,"sourceMember":"Articles/J.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Jeremoth","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Jeremoth","title":"Jeremoth","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}